      "id": "20002004",
      "title": "Certus Quartz",
      "subtitle": "Mine and Grow Crystals",
      "description": [
        "AE2's silicon — needed for every component.",
        "Found underground in white-blue crystal clusters (look for the distinctive glow)",
        "Each ore drops 1-4 crystals plus dust",
        "Alternative: drop a Certus Quartz Seed into still water and wait — growing gives more output per seed but takes time",
        "Prioritize finding a vein early — AE2 does not function without certus."
      ],
