      "title": "First Processor",
      "subtitle": "Inscriber and Logic Press",
      "description": [
        "Inscriber + Press = processor.",
        "Presses are found inside Meteorites — crashed sky stone craters scattered across the world",
        "Each meteorite contains one random press inside the central chamber",
        "You need all 4: Logic Press, Calculation Press, Engineering Press, and Silicon Press",
        "Enriched Alloy is required for the Inscriber recipe (check EMI (hover item, press R for recipe, U for uses) — crafted in a Mekanism Infuser)."
