    {
      "id": "2000200C",
      "title": "ME Network",
      "subtitle": "Controller, Drive, and Terminal",
      "description": [
        "ME Controller = brain of your storage network.",
        "Connect an ME Drive (stores items on disks) and a Terminal (the GUI you interact with)",
        "Power with FE — connect any FE source to the Controller",
        "Channels: each Controller face provides 32 channels",
        "Every AE2 device (Drive, Terminal, Bus) consumes 1 channel",
        "One Controller face supports a small to medium network.",
        "Tip: Place your Controller in the center of your base with cables radiating outward. Future expansion always connects back to the Controller — central placement minimizes cable length."
      ],
      "icon": "ae2:controller",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 2,
