    {
      "id": "20002013",
      "title": "Channels Explained",
      "subtitle": "32 per Face, 8 per Cable",
      "description": [
        "Channels are AE2's network capacity system.",
        "Controller face = 32 channels",
        "Dense Cable = 32 channels (backbone)",
        "Regular Cable = 8 channels (branches)",
        "Smart Cable shows channel usage visually — amber means partially used, green means fully allocated",
        "Place Smart Cable anywhere you suspect channel issues."
      ],
