      "title": "Crafting Patterns",
      "subtitle": "Crafting, Processing, and Smithing",
      "description": [
        "Three pattern types for different recipe categories.",
        "Crafting Patterns: standard 3x3 workbench recipes — the Molecular Assembler crafts them",
        "Processing Patterns: furnace and machine recipes — AE2 pushes items to the machine, waits, imports the result",
        "Smithing Patterns: smithing table upgrades",
        "Encode at the Pattern Encoding Terminal — drag items into the grid exactly like a crafting table, save.",
        "Tip: Processing Patterns for Mekanism machines work with any machine that has Import/Export Bus connections — Infuser, Enrichment Chamber, Crusher, PRC, and even Create Mixers."
      ],
