    {
      "id": "2000202B",
      "title": "Processing Automation",
      "subtitle": "Pattern Provider Meets Mekanism",
      "description": [
        "Set up your first automated processing chain.",
        "Place a Pattern Provider on a Mekanism machine input face",
        "Encode a Processing Pattern (example: Enriched Alloy)",
        "Place an Import Bus on the output face",
        "Request 'Craft 64 Enriched Alloy' from Terminal — AE2 pushes iron + redstone to the Infuser via Provider, waits for output, imports the alloy via Bus, marks craft complete",
        "Any machine with defined input output faces can be automated this way.",
        "This quest bridges AE2 and Mekanism — you are building the autocrafting link between your digital storage and your industrial machines. Future quests in both chapters assume this connection exists."
      ],
