    {
      "id": "2000202F",
      "title": "Large Autocrafting",
      "subtitle": "Multiple CPUs and Co-Processors",
      "description": [
        "Scale up: multiple Crafting CPUs = multiple simultaneous craft requests.",
        "Co-Processors per CPU = parallel sub-component crafting",
        "A CPU with 4 Co-Processors can craft 4 sub-components simultaneously",
        "Example: Ultimate Energy Cube needs 4 layers of recipes — each layer crafts in parallel if enough Co-Processors exist",
        "Request 'Ultimate Energy Cube' from your terminal and watch the entire cascade unfold.",
        "Requesting an Ultimate Energy Cube from your terminal triggers dozens of sub-crafts across multiple mods — Enriched Alloy in the Mekanism Infuser, steel in the Create Blast Furnace, processors in the AE2 Inscriber. This is the moment AE2 becomes the central nervous system of your factory."
      ],
