    {
      "id": "20002033",
      "title": "ME Interface",
      "subtitle": "Bidirectional AE2 to World Bridge",
      "description": [
        "The ME Interface bridges your AE2 network with the physical world.",
        "Functions: (1) Expose its inventory to the ME network — items inside are accessible from any Terminal",
        "(2) Keep a fixed stock — always maintain exactly 64 iron ingots, 32 redstone, etc",
        "(3) Accept items from external automation — Create belts and Mekanism pipes can push items INTO an Interface, and they enter the ME network",
        "Use Interfaces as the hand-off point between your Create factory and AE2 storage."
      ],
