      "title": "P2P Tunnels",
      "subtitle": "Compress 32 Channels into One",
      "description": [
        "P2P (Point-to-Point) Tunnels compress up to 32 channels into a single channel.",
        "Place a P2P Tunnel at one location, link it with a Memory Card to another P2P Tunnel at a distant location",
        "One Dense Cable can then carry 32 P2P Tunnels times 32 channels each — 1024 channels on a single backbone cable",
        "Use for: extending your network to a Mekanism factory across your base, connecting a mining outpost, or running channels into a multi-floor autocrafting tower.",
        "Tip: Use P2P Tunnels to extend your main network to a Mekanism factory 100 blocks away. One Dense Cable with a P2P Tunnel at each end carries 32 channels — enough for a full ore processing line complete with Import/Export Buses."
      ],
